| Music | `musicTracks` | AudioClip[] |  |  |  |
| Music | `musicVolume` | float | 0.45f | 0f–1f |  |
| Music | `shuffleMusic` | bool | true |  |  |
| Music | `loopCurrentTrack` | bool | true |  |  |
| Loading | `loadingAmbience` | AudioClip |  |  |  |
